exports[`foedrum: the command line > lists the commands for --help and -h 1`] = `
Usage: foedrum <command> [arguments]

Commands:
  serve                                                   Run the Cellar: brew the Brewery's batches until Ctrl+C
  doctor                                                  Check the tools Foedrum needs and the isolation level
  init [--<question> <answer>]... [--no-input]            Set up a Brewery from a few questions, each answerable by its option, then run doctor
  status [--watch]                                        List the batches and their lanes
  stuck                                                   List the Stuck batches with their options and questions
  brewers                                                 Report each brewer's attempts, outcomes, Stuck batches and tokens
  replay <batch>                                          Show a batch's events and its folded state
  resume <batch> [<step>]                                 Open a brewer attempt's Claude Code session in its worktree; take a running batch over
  retry <batch>                                           Give the step a Stuck batch stopped at another attempt
  skip <batch>                                            Go on after the step a Stuck batch stopped at
  answer <batch> <answers>...                             Answer a Stuck batch's questions, one answer each, in order
  recipe <batch> <recipe> <reason>                        Brew a batch with another recipe, from its first step
  rewind <batch> <step> <commits>...                      Take a Stuck batch back to a step, each repository at its commit
  cancel <batch>                                          Cancel a batch
  pause [<order>] [--by <time>] [--why <reason>] [--all]  Pause an order, or all with --all: nothing new starts; --by stops what runs
  continue [<order>] [--all]                              Lift the pause of an order, or every pause with --all
  stop <order> [--why <reason>]                           Stop an order now: what runs of it is killed, and its batches are Stuck until retry
  order <issue>                                           Order an issue again: <alias>#<n> of a target repository, #<n> of the Brewery
  brew <issue> [--as <name>] [--take]                     Brew an issue's batch here until it is on tap, Stuck or needs input
  rank <order> [<place>] [--why <reason>]                 Move an order in the intake's queue to place <n>, or mark it to finish first
  takeover <batch> [--as <name>]                          Hand a batch from the driver that holds it to another: --as, else this session

init takes:
  [--brewery <owner/name>]
  [--visibility <private|public>]
  [--targets <owner/name ...>]
  [--alias <repo=alias>]...
  [--use-checks <repo=y|n>]...
  [--check <repo:check=command>]...
  [--change <file=y|n>]...
  [--label <repo=y|n>]...
  [--push <y|n>]
  [--shim <n|number>]
  [--repoint <y|n>]

Every command takes --via <plugin|terminal> but serve: the surface its events record.

`;
